  "ruleText": "Ins 2604.17 Penalty Provisions. Any insurer who knowingly violates any requirement of this part shall be subject to the penalty provisions of RSA 400-A:15.\n\nSource. #9333, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11173, eff 12-5-16\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nIns 2601.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-A:1, I; 406-A:3; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.02 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-A:1, I; 406-A:3; 417:3; 417:4, I, III; 402-H:5\n\nIns 2601.03 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-A:1, I; 406-A:3; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.04 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.05 | RSA 417:4, I\n\nIns 2601.06 | RSA 406-A:1; 406-A:3; 417:1; 417:3; 417:4, I, III, XIII\n\nIns 2601.07 | RSA 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.08 | RSA 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.09 | RSA 417:4, I, II, III, IV, VI\n\nIns 2601.10 | RSA 417:4, I, II, III, IV, VI\n\nIns 2601.11 | RSA 417:4, I, III, XIII\n\nIns 2601.12 | RSA 417:4, I, III, IV\n\nIns 2601.13 | RSA 406-A:1; 406-A:3; 417:1; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.14 | RSA 406-A:1; 406-A:3; 417:1; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.15 | RSA 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2601.16 | RSA 417:4, I, III, IX\n\nIns 2601.17 | RSA 417:4, IV, VI\n\nIns 2601.18 | RSA 400-B\n\nIns 2601.19 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-A:1, I; 406-A:3\n\nIns 2601.20 | RSA 400-A:15, III; 417:10; 417:13\n\nIns 2602.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-C:8; 417:3; 417:4, III\n\nIns 2602.02 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-C:8; 417:3; 417:4, III\n\nIns 2602.03 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-C:8; 417:3; 417:4, III\n\nIns 2602.04 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-C:8; 417:4, I, III, VIII\n\nIns 2602.05 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 406-C:8; 417:4, I, III, VIII\n\nIns 2602.06 | RSA 406-C:8; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2602.07 | RSA 406-C:8; 417:3; 417:4, I, III\n\nIns 2602.08 | RSA 417:4, IV, VI\n\nIns 2602.09 | RSA 400-A:15, I; 400-B; 406-C:8; 417:1; 417:3; 417:4, I, II, III\n\nIns 2602.10 | RSA 400-A:15, III; 417:10; 417:13\n\nIns 2602.11 | RSA 400-A:15, III\n\nIns 2603.01 | RSA 415-F:3, III, IV; 415-F:7\n\nIns 2603.02 | RSA 415-F:3, III, IV; 415-F:7\n\nIns 2603.03 | RSA 415-F: